# Owner rule: local documents, scratch dirs and test artifacts never reach
# GitHub. Staying tracked: README.md, the clean*.md regulation transcriptions
# (_regulation_transcription_pages globs them from the repo root), the pip
# manifest, the i18n test baseline, index.html, and images inside folders
# (assets/, tests/ fixtures). Regulation PDFs are local-only inputs — the
# default digest path reads rules/*.json and regulation_pdf_paths() skips
# files that are absent.
